@startuml
[*] --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Press Button 1

TimeAdjustmentMode : Increase Hour + | Decrease Hour + | Increase Minute + | Decrease Minute +
TimeAdjustmentMode --> AlarmSettingMode : Press Button 2
AlarmSettingMode : Set Alarm Hour + | Set Alarm Minute + | Turn Off Alarm +
AlarmSettingMode --> TimeAdjustmentMode : Press Button 1
LightOn : Turn On Light
LightOn --> LightOff : Release Button
LightOff : Turn Off Light

AlarmSettingMode --> TriggerAlarm : Current time matches set alarm time
TriggerAlarm : Ring Alarm

LightOff --> [*] : Stop Alarm (by pressing a specific button)

@enduml
